{
  "id": "battlezone",
  "name": "BattleZone",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "BattleZone was the organized play of Wizards of the Coast's fourth and last year with the Pokémon license. From November 2002 stores bought monthly prize kits and ran BattleZone either as a league or as a tournament once a month. Each month's season had its own Best of Game card, printed plain and with a gold foil \"Winner\" stamp in the bottom right corner of the picture: Electabuzz for November and December 2002, Rocket's Sneasel for January 2003, Hitmonchan for February, Rocket's Scizor for March, Dark Ivysaur for April and Dark Venusaur for May.\n\nHitmonchan's regular-size cards, with and without the stamp, print 60 HP, a misprint for 70 HP.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Wizards Pokemon League Year 4: BattleZone",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/wizards-pokemon-league-year-4-battlezone/"
      },
